- [Cluster](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/cluster.md): Clusters of Node.js processes can be used to run multiple instances of Node.js that can distribute workloads among their application threads. When process isolation is not needed, use the `worker_threads` module instead, which allows running multiple application threads within a single Node.js instance.
